{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Incident Response Agent Roles.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Incident Response Agent Roles.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"incident response agent roles incident response agent roles","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Incident Response Agent Roles.md","fileName":"Incident Response Agent Roles.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Incident Response Agent Roles","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Multi-Agent Incident Response]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Multi-Agent Incident Response","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Incident Response Agent Roles.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Incident Response Agent Roles.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"incident response agent roles incident response agent roles","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Incident Response Agent Roles.md","fileName":"Incident Response Agent Roles.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Incident Response Agent Roles","heading":"Incident Response Agent Roles","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Incident response can be divided into focused agent roles: intake normalizes the alert, evidence collection gathers logs and telemetry, root-cause analysis identifies a fault domain, remediation drafts safe next steps, and communication prepares stakeholder updates. A practical workflow may consolidate these into pipeline, application-health, runbook, and commander roles.\n\nResponsibilities should overlap as little as possible. Narrow roles produce smaller contexts and clearer output contracts, while a coordinator combines their evidence. Tools and credentials are then assigned by role so a communication agent does not inherit production access merely because another specialist needs telemetry.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Multi-Agent Incident Response","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Incident Response Agent Roles.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Incident Response Agent Roles.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"incident response agent roles incident response agent roles","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Incident Response Agent Roles.md","fileName":"Incident Response Agent Roles.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Incident Response Agent Roles","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Multi-Agent Incident Response","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}